message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Signed Agent Receipt v0.2: reference verifier, tests and fixtures"
authors:
  - name: "Lugano Labs"
version: "0.2"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lugano-AI/signed-agent-receipt"
url: "https://lugano.ai/research/attested-agent-receipt/"
abstract: "A strict signed format for an AI agent's task record, with an offline reference verifier, tests and fixtures. A pass shows that keys the recipient chose signed and logged the record's bytes. It does not show that the recorded events happened."
keywords:
  - "AI agents"
  - "signed records"
  - "transparency logs"
  - "Merkle proofs"
